The Scala sources in this repository (`ContraTracer.scala`, `TracerA.scala`) are
translations and adaptations of the upstream Haskell modules, chiefly
`src/Control/Tracer.hs` and `src/Control/Tracer/Arrow.hs`. They have been modified
from the originals: rewritten in Scala 3 over the Cats typeclass hierarchy
(`Monad`, `Arrow`, `ArrowChoice`, `Semigroup`, `Monoid`, `Contravariant`), with an
added compilation/memoisation step so a squelched trace is allocation-free on the
JVM. Attribution comments in the source files point back to the specific upstream
files they derive from.
